# Souls of the Lost: its power and toughness come from its own ability (CR 604.3, 208.2a). Bot1 discards the permanent card Memnite
# and sacrifices the Black Lotus for mana, so with two permanent cards in the graveyard the Souls is 2/3. When Bot2's Enchanted River's
# Grasp makes it lose all abilities, the stars are worth 0 and the toughness 0+1: a 0/1, whatever the graveyard holds (CR 208.5).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Souls of the Lost
Memnite
Swamp x3
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Enchanted River's Grasp
Island x3
Island x17

