Bot1.Hand.Souls of the Lost.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Souls of the Lost.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Souls of the Lost.Toughness = 3
